{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21206","headline":"和乐天秋题曲江 · 元稹","name":"和乐天秋题曲江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十载定交契，七年镇相随。\n长安最多处，多是曲江池。\n梅杏春尚小，芰荷秋已衰。\n共爱寥落境，相将偏此时。\n緜緜红蓼水，扬扬白鹭鹚。\n诗句偶未得，酒杯聊久持。\n今来云雨旷，旧赏魂梦知。\n况乃江枫夕，和君秋兴诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}